-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are included in or distributed with this repository. The model
catalog (LiteRtModel) only points to files that the app downloads on the user's
request from their original hosts (Hugging Face). Each model has its own license,
which the user accepts by downloading it, for example:

  - Gemma (Google): the license stated on the model card
  - Qwen3, Qwen2.5 1.5B (Alibaba Cloud): Apache License 2.0
  - EuroLLM, EuroMoE (utter-project): Apache License 2.0
  - Aya Expanse 8B (Cohere Labs): CC BY-NC 4.0 and the Cohere Labs Acceptable Use
    Policy, non-commercial use only, with attribution. Apps that offer it must
    show the license to the user before the download.

Apple Foundation Models (iOS 26+) are part of the operating system and are used
through the app's own Swift bridge.
